#: kcmlayout.cpp:91
msgid "&Enable keyboard layouts"
msgstr "Aktiveer sleutelbord uitlegte"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:92
msgid ""
"Here you can completely disable this module, for example if you use other "
"tools for switching keyboard layouts."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan heeltemal deaktiveer hierdie module, vir voorbeeld as jy gebruik "
"ander nutsprogramme vir omskakeling sleutelbord uitlegte."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:107
msgid "Keyboard &model:"
msgstr "Sleutelbord model:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:110
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your "
"keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your "
"keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer "
"usually have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, which "
"is probably what you want if you don't know what kind of keyboard you have."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kies 'n sleutelbord model. Hierdie opset is onafhanklike van jou "
"sleutelbord uitleg en verwys na die \"hardeware\" model, i.e. die weg jou "
"sleutelbord is vervaardig. Moderne sleutelborde wat kom met jou rekenaar "
"gewoonlik het twee addisionele sleutels en word verwys na as \"104-key\" "
"modelle, wat is waarskynlik wat jy wil hê as jy moet nie ken wat tipe van "
"sleutelbord jy het."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:120
msgid "Pr&imary layout:"
msgstr "Primere uitleg:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:123
msgid ""
"Here you can choose your primary keyboard layout, i.e. the keyboard layout "
"used as default. The keyboard layout defines \"which keys do what\". For "
"example German keyboards have the letter 'Y' where US keyboards have the "
"letter 'Z'."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kies jou primere sleutelbord uitleg, i.e. die sleutelbord uitleg "
"gebruik word as verstek. die sleutelbord uitleg definieer \"wat sleutels "
"doen wat\". Vir voorbeeld Duits sleutelborde het die brief 'Y' waar Us "
"sleutelborde het die brief 'Z'."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:133
msgid "Prim&ary variant:"
msgstr "Primere wisselvorm:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:136
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of your primary keyboard layout. Layout "
"variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. For "
"example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as in "
"Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian letter "
"is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kies 'n wisselvorm van jou primere sleutelbord uitleg. uitleg "
"wisselvorms gewoonlik voorstelling ander sleutel kaarte vir die selfde taal. "
"vir voorbeeld, Ukraïniese uitleg dalk het vier wisselvorms: basiese, "
"winsleutels (as in Vensters), tikmasjien (as in tikmasjiene) en fonetiese "
"(elke Ukraïniese brief is rangorde op 'n translitireerde latyn een)."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:147
msgid "Additional Layouts"
msgstr "Aditionele Uitlegte"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:151
msgid ""
"You can select an arbitrary number of additional keyboard layouts. If one or "
"more additional layouts have been selected, the KDE panel will offer a "
"docked flag. By clicking on this flag you can easily switch between layouts."
msgstr ""
"Jy kan kies 'n arbitêre nommer van aditionele sleutelbord uitlegte. As een "
"of meer aditionele uitlegte het al gekose, die Kde paneel sal bied 'n gedok "
"vlag. Deur te kliek op hierdie vlag Jy kan maklik wissel tussen uitlegte."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:155
msgid "Switching Policy"
msgstr "Omskakeling Beleid"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:158
msgid "&Global"
msgstr "Globale"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:159
msgid "Application"
msgstr "Aansoek"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:160
msgid "&Window"
msgstr "Venster"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:173
msgid "Flag"
msgstr "Vlag"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:174
msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Uitleg"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:175
msgid "Keymap"
msgstr "Sleutelbord kaart"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:186
msgid "&Variant:"
msgstr "Wisselvorm:"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:190
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a variant of the selected additional keyboard layout. "
"Layout variants usually represent different key maps for the same language. "
"For example, Ukrainian layout might have four variants: basic, winkeys (as "
"in Windows), typewriter (as in typewriters) and phonetic (each Ukrainian "
"letter is placed on a transliterated latin one)."
msgstr ""
"Hier jy kan kies 'n wisselvorm van die gekose aditionele sleutelbord uitleg. "
"uitleg wisselvorms gewoonlik voorstelling ander sleutel kaarte vir die "
"selfde taal. vir voorbeeld, Ukraïniese uitleg dalk het vier wisselvorms: "
"basiese, winsleutels (as in Vensters), tikmasjien (as in tikmasjiene) en "
"fonetiese (elke Ukraïniese brief is rangorde op 'n translitireerde latyn "
"een)."

#: kcmlayout.cpp:207
msgid "&Layout"
msgstr "Uitleg"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:306
msgid "Xkb Options"
msgstr "Xkb Opsies"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:309
msgid "&Reset old options"
msgstr "Herstel ou opsies"

#: kcmlayout.cpp:600
msgid ""
"<h1>Keyboard Layout & Model</h1> Here you can choose your keyboard layout "
"and model. The 'model' refers to the type of keyboard that is connected to "
"your computer, while the keyboard layout defines \"which key does what\" and "
"may be different for different countries."
"<p> In addition to the 'Primary Layout', which will be used as the default, "
"you can specify additional layouts, which you can easily switch between "
"using the KDE panel."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Sleutelbord Uitleg & model</h1> Hier jy kan kies jou Sleutelbord Uitleg "
"en model. Die 'model' verwys na Die tipe van Sleutelbord wat is verbind na "
"jou rekenaar, terwyl Die Sleutelbord Uitleg definieer \"wat sleutel doen "
"wat\" en dalk mag wees ander vir ander lande."
"<p> In byvoeging na Die 'Primary Uitleg', wat sal wees gebruik word as Die "
"verstek, jy kan spesifiseer aditionele uitlegte, wat jy kan maklik wissel "
"tussen te gebruik Die Kde paneel."

